[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7443.99, "timestamp": "02:04:03", "text": "私は彼にそれがどんな効果があるのか​​説明していたところだった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7445.91, "timestamp": "02:04:05", "text": "あなたを信頼しています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7448.31, "timestamp": "02:04:08", "text": "えっと、やってみて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7449.75, "timestamp": "02:04:09", "text": "。 私は短剣を信じます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7451.99, "timestamp": "02:04:11", "text": "。 顔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7452.79, "timestamp": "02:04:12", "text": "はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7454.95, "timestamp": "02:04:14", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7458.629, "timestamp": "02:04:18", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7460.55, "timestamp": "02:04:20", "text": "私がクリックした時にはまだ表示されていません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7461.75, "timestamp": "02:04:21", "text": "攻撃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7462.709, "timestamp": "02:04:22", "text": "攻撃したのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7464.47, "timestamp": "02:04:24", "text": "うん。 攻撃ボタンを押しましたか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7466.149, "timestamp": "02:04:26", "text": "いいえ、短剣をクリックできません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7467.589, "timestamp": "02:04:27", "text": "クリックするよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7481.43, "timestamp": "02:04:41", "text": "攻撃においてMが有利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7483.27, "timestamp": "02:04:43", "text": "うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7485.109, "timestamp": "02:04:45", "text": "有利だよ。君が最初の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7487.189, "timestamp": "02:04:47", "text": "ターンだし、マイクはまだ動いていないからね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7488.87, "timestamp": "02:04:48", "text": "厳密に言えば、それはドラコニック語の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7489.75, "timestamp": "02:04:49", "text": "叫び声だからでもある。   ああ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7491.75, "timestamp": "02:04:51", "text": "、それもそうだね。 わかった。   今は圧倒的に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7493.83, "timestamp": "02:04:53", "text": "有利な状況だ。 それに、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7497.91, "timestamp": "